WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:02.650
A sad dream...

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.200
A dream that makes you cry...

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:11.200
But when you notice that it's a dream...
It's always after you've awakened.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.170
If you don't wake up... then that's reality...

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.130
Dream... is reality...

