00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:08.710
Not yet!

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:13.420
The monster is coming!

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:14.260
So the two of us have to protect it!

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:15.800
<b>The Little Girl's Cage</b>
So the two of us have to protect it!

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.180
<b>The Little Girl's Cage</b>

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.240
If we don't protect it, we can't play at our playground anymore!
<b>The Little Girl's Cage</b>

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.010
If we don't protect it, we can't play at our playground anymore!

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.770
It's alright.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.090
Cut it out.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.000
Mai!

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:53.460
But...

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:59.090
Sayuri-san always thought about you and did her best.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.220
So you also have to...

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.730
Yuuichi-san, are you alright?

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.490
It looks like you were up late last night.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.490
Sorry, it's alright.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.990
If it's like that, then it's fine.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.220
Today's also cold.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:39.390
Yeah, it is.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:42.260
But, aren't you getting to be used to it, Yuuichi?

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:43.260
You think so?

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.400
Good morning!

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.650
Did you see yesterday's drama?

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:51.650
Yeah, I saw it.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.440
Kawasumi-san seems to be rampaging again.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.490
Kawasumi? She won't learn from her mistakes.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.110
That idiot!

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:03.910
Yuuichi!

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.710
Who said that she was rampaging?

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:13.380
Sorry, excuse me!
Who said that she was rampaging?

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:13.920
Sorry, excuse me!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.710
Let me pass.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.170
Mai.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.930
Yuuichi, I...

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:25.680
I know.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:27.600
You have good restraint.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.310
Let's go, Mai.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:32.940
Open a path for me.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.150
It's Kuze....

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:37.150
Why, it's you guys again?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:38.900
You are...!

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:42.780
Even if Kurata-san is a member of the student council, there is a limit to defending someone.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.370
Yuuichi...

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.000
Don't waste Sayuri-san's feelings.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:51.790
So, what did you guys do this time?

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.170
Hey wait!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.250
We didn't do anything.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.050
We couldn't do anything.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.380
Mai, let's go.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:01.760
I said wait!

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.190
I won't forgive...

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:18.280
I won't forgive you if you make Sayuri cry.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.570
Let's go, Mai.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.000
It's alright.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.590
Don't worry, just stay still.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.050
You don't want to be suspended for doing that again.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:43.510
I'm unarmed.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:44.590
I see.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.050
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:48.060
Yuuichi, it's alright.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.470
But, your blood is still...

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.020
This scar isn't enough.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.850
Sayuri was hurt again all because of me.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:55.190
No!

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:57.150
It's just because bad things happened one after another!

00:05:58.690 --> 00:05:59.940
It's not Mai's fault.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.580
But, I don't know what I should do.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:11.870
Mai...

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.710
Don't try to take responsibility for everything by yourself.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.250
I'll think as well.

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.840
Let's think together on what we'll do.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.500
Yuuichi...

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:32.980
Isn't it bright?

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:34.520
Eh? Yeah...

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:35.730
I'm sorry.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:36.650
How do you feel?

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.650
Yes, I'm feeling better already.

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:40.570
Then here, let's take your temperature.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.450
Sayuri was thinking about me all the time.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.700
But I'm always hurting her.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:56.790
Because she was with me... Sayuri got hurt...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.050
It's true that she got hurt because she was with me...

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:08.260
Mai...

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:15.480
So tonight, I'm going to end everything.

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:18.400
"End"... you mean that monster?

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.820
Yuuichi, I need your help.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:25.740
Yeah, if I'm useful to you, I'll help you.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:27.530
Thank you.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:36.910
Yuuichi!

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.750
Yuuichi-san, I'm sorry.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.290
It'll be ready soon.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:44.250
Akiko-san, I'm sorry, please eat before me.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.010
You're going somewhere now?

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:48.840
I'm sorry.

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:53.760
Then I'll have Yuuichi-san's meal ready to be eaten later on.

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:54.770
Yes.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:02.480
Yuuichi.

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:04.610
Nayuki.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:08.950
When you come back, I'll warm your dinner up.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.700
Yeah, thank you.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:16.080
I don't know what you're doing, but best of luck.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:17.500
Yeah.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.140
Sorry, I'm late.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:35.850
Yuuichi.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.230
That...

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:41.400
I thought it would be a bit helpful.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.520
But, what is the monster, really?

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:48.490
And also, aren't there a lot?

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:51.530
I'll end it.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.290
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.170
When it's done, the gyuudon.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:06.880
You really like it, don't you?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.260
It's here!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.470
Mai!

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:16.470
What are you!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.450
Mai...

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:39.870
Mai is aiming for the inside of the creatures mouth...

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:40.870
Maybe I should meet up with her...

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:42.660
No, I'd just be in her way.

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:50.170
I don't have time to rest, do I!?

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:01.310
The monster is coming...

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:07.650
What was that...!?

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:23.620
Mai!

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:24.750
Dodge it!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:28.920
You dodged well.

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:31.210
Mai, you got injured!?

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:33.510
You... your leg is...

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:35.180
Show it to me.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.390
Yuuichi, it's embarrassing.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:42.220
It's not the time to be saying that.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.310
The wound doesn't seem to be that bad.

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:49.520
But, the bone may be fractured.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:50.690
Does it hurt?

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:51.480
No...

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:52.440
But...

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:53.860
Yuuichi...

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:55.740
Carry me...

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:59.320
Say something to me.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:00.700
Why?

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:02.660
Because it's awkward.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.790
What should I say?

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.000
Anything is alright.

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:10.000
Then, how about shiritori?
(T/L Note: Shiritori is a Japanese word game played by saying a word that starts with the last syllable of the word given by the previous player.)

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.130
(T/L Note: Shiritori is a Japanese word game played by saying a word that starts with the last syllable of the word given by the previous player.)

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.040
Do you like that?
(T/L Note: Shiritori is a Japanese word game played by saying a word that starts with the last syllable of the word given by the previous player.)

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:11.380
(T/L Note: Shiritori is a Japanese word game played by saying a word that starts with the last syllable of the word given by the previous player.)

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.210
I don't hate it.
(T/L Note: Shiritori is a Japanese word game played by saying a word that starts with the last syllable of the word given by the previous player.)

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:12.750
(T/L Note: Shiritori is a Japanese word game played by saying a word that starts with the last syllable of the word given by the previous player.)

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:14.210
Then you first, Mai.
(T/L Note: Shiritori is a Japanese word game played by saying a word that starts with the last syllable of the word given by the previous player.)

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:15.800
Ringo. (Apple)

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:16.760
Ringo?

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.720
Is it bad?

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:18.680
Nope.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:19.720
It's not bad.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:22.510
Um... then Gorilla.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.140
Lakkyou. (Shallot)

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:25.310
Umiushi. (Sea slug)

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:26.770
Shirimenjyako.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:28.730
You mean Chirimenjyako. (Boiled and dried baby sardines)

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.860
Then, Chirimenjyako.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.440
Ko... Komuragaeri... (Leg cramps)

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:36.860
But hey! Don't selfishly ignore the rule!

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:38.360
Yuuichi, you're too picky.

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:40.200
You're just uncommitting.

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.410
It won't be a game unless you obey the basic rules.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:44.870
There is some truth in what you say.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.460
You're a strange person.

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:49.000
Is that a good thing?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.710
Somewhat...

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:57.420
It's coming!

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:10.190
Without thinking... just deal with it, or avoid it.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.230
You, in that condition...

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.150
It's alright.

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.780
I can move my right leg.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:18.030
Maybe... you...

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:19.400
In the courtyard.

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:22.160
Mai!

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:34.750
I'll be waiting.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.630
What on earth... was that...

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:42.510
Mai!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:45.850
I'll be waiting.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.380
I'm not lying!

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:21.090
It's really coming!

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:23.430
I can't protect it on my own!

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.140
Protect it with me!

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:27.220
What!?

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:02.130
Mai... you did it?

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:05.510
Yeah...

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:07.470
What now?

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:12.020
Mai! You're injured!

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:15.480
That was the last one.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:17.560
Even if it is...

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.020
It's alright.

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:20.610
Thanks.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.320
Yuuichi, you came.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.200
Of course I'd come.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.120
But where did you come from?

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.160
From the rooftop.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.490
You serious!?

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.210
Because it's too weak of a strike from the top of the stairs.

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.420
That's not the problem here!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.210
I'm not that foolish.

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.510
I had considered the impact of the fall.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.340
I don't understand it well, but...

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:50.310
Yuuichi... promise... gyuudon...

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.100
Mai!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.770
Just wear that.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:57.770
You need it, Yuuichi, you're going outside...

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:00.150
I'm alright.

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:01.440
I'll come back immediately.

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:02.820
Yeah...

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:21.880
I am now thinking that the girl was Mai, who wished that the lies would turn into reality...

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:26.340
...and that there weren't any monsters in the beginning.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:38.730
Maybe...!

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.720
Stop it! Mai!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.350
Stop it!!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.150
Yuuichi, you're a hindrance...

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:23.730
Stop it, Mai!

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:26.360
There weren't any monsters to start with!

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:30.320
You were creating them. It was your power!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.330
It's alright, Mai.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.410
You don't need to fight anymore!

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.250
It's over, Mai!

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.210
There are still some more!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.710
It seems that you and I have met in the past...

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.840
Sorry, for not remembering for such a long time...

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:51.300
No, we've never met before.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.140
We played, didn't we?

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:57.220
Maybe it was only for a short time...

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:02.230
But... we played together like friends a long time ago.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:06.360
That boy... he went somewhere...

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:10.780
But... we're here together again.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:18.750
You have to realize.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.580
You don't need to do this anymore.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:26.040
You can laugh happily with Sayuri-san and the others.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.380
You can cry when you want to.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:32.130
You can say you're in pain when you're having a hard time.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:39.640
You're not alone anymore.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:43.060
Really?

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:45.650
Really.

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.030
It's alright.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:15.470
Thank you... Yuuichi...

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:21.560
You told me that I'm not alone...

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.770
And just like we promised, you came here...

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.770
I like you, Yuuichi.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.530
I like Sayuri a lot, too.

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:34.860
But she's alone.

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:40.700
I wish that my memories will stay with Yuuichi and Sayuri forever...

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.660
What?

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:54.420
Mai!

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:57.090
Sayuri.

00:18:57.220 --> 00:19:00.390
Mai, why are you always like that?

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:03.470
You always choose everything by yourself.

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:08.190
It's not good, trying to solve things all by yourself like that...

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:09.270
But...

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.570
No buts...

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:12.940
Sayuri-san...

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.160
You still have them on.

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:24.830
Those really suits you, Mai.

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:32.250
It's because I got it from Sayuri.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:38.220
Sayuri, what do you want for your birthday?

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:40.140
Anything is alright.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.310
If it's something that Mai chooses.

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:47.310
Yuuichi, can you choose it with me?

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:50.940
Yeah, of course.

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:21.970
As I thought, everyone was wearing a beautiful outfit, right?

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:23.720
Yeah, of course.

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:26.180
What were you wearing, Yuuichi-san?

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:28.770
Me? I was wearing a tuxedo.

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.520
I wanted to see it too.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.110
Yuuichi-san's appearance in a tuxedo.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.440
You think so?

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:37.440
Yes!

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:42.160
Then, I'll show you next year.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:44.830
Yeah, that's good.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:46.870
What's wrong?

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.210
Nothing, I'll wear a dress then.

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:55.960
Yeah, but maybe you might not have "enough" to wear the dress?

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:01.130
Yuuichi-san, you're mean!

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:03.640
Why do you say that when you know I'm sensitive about it?

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:05.680
You care about that?

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:09.230
Yuuichi-san, I dislike people who say things like that.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:10.850
Sorry, sorry.

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:11.940
It's a joke.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:14.480
But it would be great if you would fill out some more by next year.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.400
Yeah, you're right...

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:18.740
It would be great if it would fill out more by next year.

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:27.870
I'll make you look me over again then, Yuuichi-san.

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.080
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:32.870
Then, I'll be going now.

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.210
Please look forward to it.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:44.640
Um...

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:45.970
Me?

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:49.770
You're the person who's often with Misaka-san, correct?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:52.310
Misaka...?

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:55.020
The person who's often in the courtyard.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:57.230
Yeah, then that's Shiori.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:58.900
Why?

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:04.360
Um, do you have any idea what Misaka-san's illness is?

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:30.250
In between the flowing clouds
nagareru kunono aimani

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:35.990
The crawling blue sky
muzuita aozora ga

00:22:36.610 --> 00:22:41.670
Even causes the familiar town
minareta machinami de sae

00:22:41.930 --> 00:22:47.140
To light up
kagayakasete kureru

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:52.980
Running small back
kaketeku chiisana senaka

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:58.870
The two at that time were...
anokoro no futariga

00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:04.290
The reason for the spilling pain
koboreru itami no wakewo

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:10.030
Hidden with innocence
mujyakisa de kakushita

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:18.400
Time is flowing quietly
tokiwa shizukani nagare

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:24.030
The gentle winds blow
yasashii kaze ga fuita

00:23:24.280 --> 00:23:29.660
Numbed feelings too will
Kajikanda omoimo

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:35.910
Change to a smile
egao ni kawarukara

